{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Web opens the back door and weeps, allowing their spiders to scurry all over them in worry. They pick up the sash they made for Baeshra and put it on. They pull the locket out of the pocket, look at the flower petal, then put it back and clutch it tightly. They think to themselves *You will be honored, Apex. I will see you remembered, your death avenged, what you left behind have meaning. I will continue to live, because I know you would want me to. I promise not to disappoint you. I will be the person who believed I could be. I will protect the others the way you did. The tribe will live on, I promise you.* Web takes out a small vial and drips a small portion of Baeshra's blood as well as theirs into it. *Much honor, my dear. All the days I have left will be spent in your memory.*","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:41:33.079000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T22:43:32.604000Z","id":"739976279297884283","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
