{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"It is made mostly of bear meat and fungus, but they incorporate some of the local plants and sea life they have picked up. They cannot taste it, but the smell begins to bring tears to their eyes.","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:45:57.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739977388842287126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"They watch the food cook, then step out back. The last of Baeshra's blood they have they sprinkle on their crops, and taste themselves. *Now you will always be a part of me, and of this land. No matter what happens, your bravery will be remembered by the land itself*  they think.","created_at":"2020-08-03T22:47:59.389000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T22:50:29.218000Z","id":"739977899599200307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
